WEBVTT

01:45.500 --> 01:52.040
<b>Yin and Yang</b>

01:47.230 --> 01:51.700
I thought I'd found a moving rag, 
but you're that shinobi.

01:52.220 --> 01:55.480
You're looking ragged. 
Is it time for you to die?

02:02.600 --> 02:03.840
Oh?

02:03.840 --> 02:07.070
Didn't think you could trade blows 
with me in your current state.

02:07.070 --> 02:10.080
You truly are exceptional.

02:10.300 --> 02:12.710
<i>It'll be difficult to defeat him 
without suffering any injuries.</i>

02:12.710 --> 02:15.770
You're more exhausted than you realize.

02:15.770 --> 02:17.590
Your movements are slow.

02:17.860 --> 02:20.110
Your center of gravity on your left side...

02:20.110 --> 02:23.550
I can tell by your posture 
that you're not used to protecting it.

02:24.600 --> 02:28.300
Your left arm's too badly 
injured to use, isn't it?

02:41.560 --> 02:43.810
Okay, okay. No more.

02:44.080 --> 02:46.860
Let's not waste time 
on pointless shows of force.

02:46.860 --> 02:48.090
It's not pointless.

02:48.090 --> 02:50.690
All fights begin with an assessment 
of each other's preliminary movements.

02:50.910 --> 02:52.090
It's pointless.

02:52.090 --> 02:54.710
First of all, it's unscientific. 
Second of all, this isn't the time for that.

02:54.710 --> 02:55.950
It's meaningless.

02:56.190 --> 03:00.080
What we should be doing right now 
is gathering information.

03:00.340 --> 03:03.960
What has he experienced so far? 
Where is the Asaemon assigned to him?

03:03.960 --> 03:08.010
Who is that girl over there?

03:08.010 --> 03:10.970
If you kill each other, we won't be 
able to acquire any useful information.

03:11.290 --> 03:12.550
So...

03:14.790 --> 03:18.990
We'll take the information without killing.

03:18.990 --> 03:22.480
I know how to do 
that without killing anyone.

03:23.140 --> 03:24.040
Oh?

03:24.040 --> 03:27.560
You intend to fight against the both of us?

03:27.560 --> 03:30.320
<i>Is now the time to move? But...</i>

03:30.720 --> 03:34.060
<i>These two are undoubtedly strong.</i>

03:36.840 --> 03:39.360
<i>I'll have to change my tactics.</i>

03:43.280 --> 03:46.400
<i>After all, I'm not Gabimaru 
the Hollow anymore.</i>

03:47.050 --> 03:48.800
What do you think you're doing?

03:48.800 --> 03:51.510
Given your strength, I have a suggestion.

03:51.910 --> 03:53.880
Why don't we work together?

04:03.720 --> 04:05.720
You didn't move.

04:05.720 --> 04:08.120
So you're not trying to fool us.

04:08.500 --> 04:10.480
But I'm disappointed.

04:10.760 --> 04:13.350
I seek strong warriors,

04:13.350 --> 04:16.500
not cowards who easily bow 
their heads to their enemies.

04:16.500 --> 04:19.280
Your thinking is simplistic.

04:19.990 --> 04:23.360
I'd like to know why 
you're willing to do this.

04:26.920 --> 04:27.750
What?

04:27.750 --> 04:30.880
What are those Tensen monsters?

04:30.880 --> 04:34.170
I didn't run into anything 
so powerful! Why not?

04:34.170 --> 04:35.090
I don't know.

04:35.090 --> 04:37.090
They can regenerate?

04:37.090 --> 04:39.040
Breaking their necks 
and burning them doesn't kill them?

04:39.040 --> 04:41.120
What about their organs? 
What were they like?

04:41.120 --> 04:42.350
I don't know.

04:42.350 --> 04:44.390
I don't know any specifics.

04:44.390 --> 04:47.420
I just want to earn 
a pardon so I can see someone.

04:47.420 --> 04:49.720
I'll do anything to achieve that.

04:50.120 --> 04:52.230
Please help me.

04:52.800 --> 04:56.380
But what proof do you have 
that any of that is true?

04:56.380 --> 04:58.160
All right, I'm in!

04:58.840 --> 05:02.460
If we can get to Horai and meet these Tensen, 
then it's two birds with one stone.

05:02.460 --> 05:04.690
We just happened to be lost, too.

05:04.690 --> 05:08.130
You're not wrong, 
but isn't he our competition?

05:08.130 --> 05:09.690
It's fine.

05:09.690 --> 05:12.630
After all, I'm not really 
interested in the pardon.

05:13.480 --> 05:16.340
I thought you wanted to 
improve your sword skills.

05:16.340 --> 05:17.880
That's just my method.

05:17.880 --> 05:21.890
I want to become immortal.

05:22.800 --> 05:26.140
Don't tell me you intend to consume 
the Elixir of Life yourself.

05:27.120 --> 05:28.860
No.

05:28.860 --> 05:32.270
Being literally immortal would be boring.

05:32.270 --> 05:34.650
I'll achieve something grand that 
will be talked about throughout the land.

05:35.050 --> 05:39.810
My name will be spoken endlessly across 
generations, and I'll become a legend.

05:39.810 --> 05:44.150
The name Tamiya Gantetsusai will 
never grow old and never die.

05:44.150 --> 05:52.680
This appearance and these words will survive 
as pictures and words in the distant future.

05:52.970 --> 05:56.040
That's what it means to be truly immortal.

05:56.440 --> 05:59.600
What a truly preposterous goal.

05:59.600 --> 06:01.800
Whatever you say. I'm serious about it.

06:02.170 --> 06:05.560
So, what will you do, Whatever-emon?

06:05.560 --> 06:07.430
I've made my decision.

06:07.430 --> 06:09.210
It's "Asaemon."

06:09.210 --> 06:12.310
I'm not interested in your bombastic goals,

06:12.310 --> 06:16.320
but I am very interested in immortal beings.

06:18.080 --> 06:21.330
Allow me to defeat the Tensen.

06:21.530 --> 06:23.950
Allow me to dissect them 
once you've killed them.

06:25.490 --> 06:27.280
Then we have a deal.

06:28.510 --> 06:31.030
If you could provide us 
with additional information...

06:31.030 --> 06:33.720
First, concerning this girl...

06:36.590 --> 06:38.670
What's so surprising?

06:39.010 --> 06:42.230
She was a young girl until a moment ago,

06:42.470 --> 06:44.110
but she's grown.

06:44.660 --> 06:46.470
Don't worry about that.

06:46.470 --> 06:48.380
It's one of the mysteries 
of female development.

06:48.380 --> 06:49.960
That's not the issue here.

06:50.760 --> 06:54.860
Ga... Gabimaru.

06:54.860 --> 06:57.240
You can talk now?

06:58.760 --> 07:00.320
Who are you?

07:00.320 --> 07:03.880
No, more importantly, 
tell me what you know about the Elixir.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.570
Sorry.

07:12.590 --> 07:15.000
Thank you for saving me.

07:16.280 --> 07:18.200
If you can speak, I'd like you to tell me.

07:18.720 --> 07:20.140
That mysterious power...

07:20.900 --> 07:23.540
Are you like the Tensen?

07:26.570 --> 07:29.260
No matter how you look at it, it's strange.

07:29.460 --> 07:30.840
Senta-dono?

07:30.840 --> 07:36.700
You said the Tensen are gods 
who screen people's souls in Horai, correct?

07:36.700 --> 07:37.680
Yes.

07:37.970 --> 07:41.770
After listening to you, I'm certain of it.

07:41.770 --> 07:45.980
It's simply not possible 
for this place to be the real Shinsenkyo.

07:46.360 --> 07:49.260
It's clearly a man-made religious system.

07:49.260 --> 07:50.880
What do you mean?

07:50.880 --> 07:53.480
The terms "Horai," "Eishu,"

07:53.480 --> 07:58.800
and the Tensen's names are all originally 
terms used by different religions.

07:58.800 --> 08:02.780
It's a mysterious island. 
Who cares if they're all mixed up?

08:03.420 --> 08:05.290
That's the problem.

08:05.290 --> 08:10.800
All the mixed-up elements come 
from culturally specific interpretations.

08:10.800 --> 08:11.780
Okay?

08:11.780 --> 08:13.990
<i>He's in the zone now.</i>

08:11.780 --> 08:16.440
Which means they were preceded 
by human religious views.

08:16.440 --> 08:19.190
The elements are combined crudely, too.

08:19.200 --> 08:23.520
Specific eras and cultures 
are combined in a superficial way.

08:23.520 --> 08:26.360
I recognize this type of distortion.

08:26.360 --> 08:27.540
Uh, wh-what?

08:27.540 --> 08:29.290
It's Moro Makiya.

08:29.540 --> 08:33.400
He was the founder of a new religion 
plotting to overthrow the shogunate.

08:33.400 --> 08:35.760
The religion he founded was like this place.

08:35.760 --> 08:39.290
There was a certain distortion created 
by his patchwork of various religions.

08:39.780 --> 08:43.600
That's why I previously felt 
this place was defective.

08:43.600 --> 08:48.290
It's not just the faith, but the monsters 
and configuration of the island as well.

08:48.740 --> 08:51.450
This island most likely has a creator.

08:51.450 --> 08:55.800
This is just a theory, but it's not 
that no one returns from this place.

08:55.800 --> 08:58.410
From the start, the intention was that only

08:58.410 --> 09:01.320
humans who'd transformed 
into flowers would return.

09:01.320 --> 09:04.320
However—no, precisely because of that—

09:04.320 --> 09:06.200
if someone's deliberate 
intention is behind this,

09:06.200 --> 09:08.820
then it could also be our clue 
to understanding this place.

09:08.820 --> 09:12.840
We should be able to find both 
the Elixir and a way to escape.

09:15.080 --> 09:17.960
I-I'm s-s-sorry. I rambled on.

09:17.960 --> 09:20.060
Don't worry about it.

09:20.060 --> 09:22.470
You're truly knowledgeable, Senta-dono.

09:22.710 --> 09:24.470
You enjoy this kind of thing, don't you?

09:24.470 --> 09:27.210
I w-wouldn't say I <i>enjoy</i> it, exactly...

09:27.210 --> 09:30.170
You've very dependable as long 
as you're not keeping watch.

09:30.720 --> 09:34.030
If your theory's correct, 
then we have a problem.

09:34.030 --> 09:36.750
That intention has continued on
for over a thousand years.

09:36.750 --> 09:39.730
Are we capable of beating it?

09:39.730 --> 09:43.980
It's possible Gabimaru 
and the girl are already dead.

09:46.190 --> 09:48.360
No, I'm sure he's alive.

09:48.760 --> 09:51.110
And he hasn't given up.

09:51.110 --> 09:54.570
He's somewhere on this island formulating 
a plan and carrying it out

09:54.570 --> 09:56.680
in order to see his beloved.

09:57.080 --> 10:00.340
That's the kind of man Gabimaru is.

10:01.120 --> 10:06.290
If you know the Tensen's secrets 
and how to defeat them,

10:06.620 --> 10:08.150
please tell me.

10:13.600 --> 10:17.600
If there's some power 
that can be used to fight the Tensen,

10:17.600 --> 10:19.170
then I'd like you to tell me what it is.

10:21.580 --> 10:22.600
Tao.

10:22.830 --> 10:23.930
Tao?

10:23.930 --> 10:26.580
Is that what the power is called?

10:28.210 --> 10:31.300
Tao. Strong, weak.

10:31.700 --> 10:36.280
Mind, body. Strong, weak.

10:36.280 --> 10:39.170
Tanden, turn.

10:39.170 --> 10:41.480
Strong, weak.

10:43.160 --> 10:44.330
Scary?

10:46.330 --> 10:49.340
Tao. Strong, weak.

10:47.980 --> 10:49.340
<i>I don't understand.</i>

10:49.790 --> 10:53.740
Maybe by "tanden," she means what 
the navel is called in martial arts.

10:53.740 --> 10:56.280
To be precise, it's just below the navel.

10:56.280 --> 10:59.360
It's what they call 
the meridian in Chinese medicine.

10:59.840 --> 11:02.230
So, what exactly is tao?

11:02.230 --> 11:03.510
No idea.

11:05.550 --> 11:08.990
Tao is the power 
that flows through all things.

11:08.990 --> 11:11.560
"The power that flows through all things?"

11:11.560 --> 11:14.240
And the Tensen control that?

11:14.490 --> 11:15.660
Yes.

11:15.660 --> 11:19.160
Everything in this world 
is created by the flow of tao.

11:19.160 --> 11:23.750
To touch tao is to touch 
the origin of the universe.

11:23.750 --> 11:25.390
I don't get it.

11:25.390 --> 11:28.340
After all, it's rooted in a specific belief.

11:28.340 --> 11:32.510
It seems difficult to describe in 
a way that we'd understand.

11:33.390 --> 11:35.060
Aw, man.

11:35.060 --> 11:40.200
Isn't there a hot teacher who's good 
at explaining things around here?

11:58.920 --> 12:02.790
Do that all you want. 
I still won't train you to use a sword.

12:03.690 --> 12:07.930
Please, Master. Teach me to use a sword.

12:08.460 --> 12:14.080
Didn't you swear that we'd avenge Tenza?

12:15.760 --> 12:16.840
You can't.

12:18.010 --> 12:22.340
I don't want to see any more 
young lives end before my eyes.

12:22.940 --> 12:25.020
I'm the only one who needs to fight.

12:25.240 --> 12:29.520
I'll avenge him, but I won't wait 
for your skills to improve.

12:29.520 --> 12:32.240
I want to fight too, Master.

12:32.240 --> 12:35.530
As I told you before, I am not your master.

12:35.950 --> 12:37.960
I haven't taught you anything.

12:37.960 --> 12:39.670
Well, I'm gonna call you that.

12:39.670 --> 12:41.910
You're no ordinary man.

12:42.250 --> 12:44.400
I attacked you from behind just now.

12:44.400 --> 12:46.830
Instincts alone don't explain that.

12:49.040 --> 12:50.340
Please.

12:50.710 --> 12:52.760
Please teach me.

12:53.400 --> 12:57.580
I don't want to see any more 
people I love die before my eyes.

13:00.140 --> 13:02.260
I can't take it.

13:05.110 --> 13:09.270
Please be my master.

13:10.260 --> 13:14.820
This feeling can't be taught overnight.

13:15.430 --> 13:16.820
It's too difficult.

13:17.680 --> 13:21.030
Everything in this world 
produces a unique wave.

13:22.030 --> 13:23.240
A wave?

13:23.240 --> 13:24.160
Yes.

13:24.160 --> 13:26.740
They're waves flowing around our bodies.

13:27.780 --> 13:29.970
I can sense those.

13:30.960 --> 13:35.140
Because of that, I know your height, 
weight, and that your hair is tied up.

13:35.140 --> 13:36.870
Are you for real?

13:37.290 --> 13:38.310
Of course.

13:38.980 --> 13:42.230
Using the waves improves 
not only one's senses,

13:42.230 --> 13:44.050
but their physical capabilities as well.

13:44.050 --> 13:49.070
Mastering the use of tao grants 
one godlike strength and body.

13:49.070 --> 13:52.850
You must order your thoughts 
in order to sense them.

13:52.850 --> 13:56.070
Neither too fierce nor too quiet.

13:56.070 --> 14:00.070
Tao, mind. Strong, weak.

14:00.400 --> 14:03.440
Stillness and motion, yin and yang.

14:03.440 --> 14:08.960
That cycle, that flow, is the key 
to drawing out the power of tao.

14:09.140 --> 14:13.640
Between rage and calmness, 
or else both simultaneously.

14:13.640 --> 14:17.080
You must achieve that state of mind.

14:17.080 --> 14:20.280
That will make it easier 
to detect the waves.

14:20.710 --> 14:23.090
In Buddhism, it's known as the middle way.

14:23.520 --> 14:27.720
That state of mind allows one 
to exceed their normal capabilities.

14:27.720 --> 14:28.850
For example,

14:29.150 --> 14:32.390
it allows people to withstand 
greater strength than their own

14:32.390 --> 14:35.870
or survive what should be fatal injuries.

14:36.230 --> 14:39.380
The skill cannot be acquired
 immediately, however.

14:39.380 --> 14:42.030
In the first place, 
there is much I don't know.

14:42.030 --> 14:43.900
Then at least teach me to use a sword—

14:43.900 --> 14:45.680
You have more fundamental 
problems than that.

14:45.680 --> 14:47.530
The way you wield a blade is all wrong.

14:47.530 --> 14:48.470
What?

14:48.470 --> 14:50.980
Then how am I supposed to do it?

14:54.920 --> 14:57.640
First, keep your left 
hand on your center line.

14:57.640 --> 15:00.460
Your right shoulder and left foot 
should face the same direction.

15:00.950 --> 15:03.620
You should only grip it tightly 
in the moment you attack.

15:03.620 --> 15:05.680
The rest of the time, grip it loosely.

15:06.470 --> 15:10.250
Don't swing your left arm wildly. 
Be aware of its position.

15:07.200 --> 15:10.860
<i>Huh? Is he teaching me everything?</i>

15:10.860 --> 15:13.200
<i>Is he an idiot, or is this on purpose?</i>

15:14.570 --> 15:17.490
Killing is wrong.

15:17.730 --> 15:21.360
All life is precious.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.360
Master!

15:25.500 --> 15:27.450
The speed of your sword 
is important as well.

15:27.450 --> 15:30.200
If you keep it free of oils, 
the blade will last longer.

15:33.840 --> 15:37.600
Everything in this world 
produces a unique wave.

15:37.830 --> 15:40.050
I can sense those.

15:45.260 --> 15:48.690
Don't rely on brute force. 
Use the weight of the sword.

15:49.010 --> 15:50.230
You won't get tired as easily.

15:50.690 --> 15:52.720
Only turn your hips at the last moment.

15:53.170 --> 15:55.600
Keep your knees low and chest high.

15:59.800 --> 16:04.360
I cannot be your master. I have a job to do.

16:05.320 --> 16:07.960
But you're free to study 
and learn on your own.

16:10.200 --> 16:12.200
Yes, Master.

16:12.580 --> 16:16.260
But it's a fact that we don't stand 
a chance against those monsters.

16:16.670 --> 16:18.720
I'll need to hone my skills.

16:18.930 --> 16:21.600
But on this island, 
I don't have that kind of time.

16:22.640 --> 16:23.800
Unbelievable.

16:24.240 --> 16:25.980
We can't even have a nice long chat.

16:29.980 --> 16:33.790
Supposing tao is the way to kill the Tensen,

16:33.790 --> 16:37.360
it's not like we can take 
our time learning about it.

16:37.620 --> 16:40.860
The best way to learn to fight 
is in the middle of a battle.

16:40.860 --> 16:43.480
And fortunately, we've got plenty 
of monsters to practice with.

16:46.860 --> 16:50.880
Now teach me the power of tao, miss.

16:51.690 --> 16:55.040
What a fiery old man.

16:58.130 --> 17:01.800
Who... is that?

17:03.860 --> 17:09.150
If you throw humans into the pit, 
they'll eventually merge with the flowers.

17:09.500 --> 17:12.140
You made something amazing, Mu Dan.

17:12.390 --> 17:16.030
Now we'll be able to 
harvest tan more efficiently.

17:16.240 --> 17:19.640
Don't kill the humans 
you throw into the pit.

17:20.200 --> 17:22.890
What happens if they try to get out?

17:23.130 --> 17:26.740
Once they're weakened, 
it's too deep for humans to climb out.

17:27.530 --> 17:31.120
Besides, the walls will block their escape.

17:31.470 --> 17:35.870
They want everyone 
to join them on their side.

17:36.360 --> 17:38.650
They grab on and don't let go.

18:08.480 --> 18:11.410
<i>We won't be able to overwhelm them by force.</i>

18:11.410 --> 18:13.440
<i>We need to assess the situation.</i>

18:14.270 --> 18:15.570
B-Brother?

18:15.570 --> 18:19.250
We're gonna kill those shitheads, Toma.

18:20.930 --> 18:23.450
No, we should leave the island 
immediately and tend our—

18:23.450 --> 18:25.650
We're killing those shitheads, Toma.

18:25.650 --> 18:26.190
But—

18:26.190 --> 18:28.540
We're killing those shitheads, Toma.

18:29.780 --> 18:30.730
Okay.

18:31.090 --> 18:33.720
Then let's come up with a plan of attack.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.660
We don't need a plan.

18:35.660 --> 18:37.310
But how...

18:37.480 --> 18:41.190
Their weakness is their lower body.

18:42.800 --> 18:45.210
When I chopped its body in two,

18:45.210 --> 18:48.320
that monster started regenerating 
from its lower body,

18:48.320 --> 18:51.080
not the half with its head and heart.

18:51.340 --> 18:55.450
Which means its weakness 
is the groin or navel.

18:55.450 --> 18:57.710
It was kind of plant-like,

18:57.710 --> 19:01.200
so it makes sense that its weakness is the 
bottom half with the roots and not its top.

19:01.200 --> 19:02.830
<i>I'm impressed, Brother.</i>

19:03.440 --> 19:06.080
<i>That's what you call assessing a situation 
and coming up with a plan.</i>

19:06.800 --> 19:07.920
What?

19:07.920 --> 19:10.880
Nothing. I'm just taking that in.

19:10.880 --> 19:13.850
Taking in what? Oh, right...

19:17.500 --> 19:21.200
You finally feel like 
eating monster flesh, too?

19:21.200 --> 19:23.980
No. Wait, that's not a monster—

19:23.980 --> 19:25.300
Just eat.

19:25.300 --> 19:27.980
You won't last long unless 
you build up your strength.

19:27.980 --> 19:29.490
Brother!

19:28.800 --> 19:31.980
Ah, you're alive.

19:34.810 --> 19:38.490
Forgive me for not 
announcing my presence first.

19:38.760 --> 19:41.500
Don't be afraid.

19:42.280 --> 19:43.030
Who are you?

19:43.030 --> 19:44.240
Doesn't matter.

19:44.930 --> 19:47.670
You're a monster. We'll kill it.

19:47.670 --> 19:51.550
Oh, no. I'm capable of reason.

19:51.550 --> 19:53.380
Let's talk.

19:53.380 --> 19:57.800
I simply came to investigate 
on orders from the Tensen.

19:58.470 --> 20:00.250
The Tensen?

20:00.250 --> 20:03.410
You mean those things 
that are neither man nor woman?

20:03.410 --> 20:05.850
Indeed. They are our masters.

20:06.260 --> 20:14.680
My colleagues have gone to scout out 
the other humans who arrived on the island.

20:14.690 --> 20:17.440
The other doshi.

20:17.440 --> 20:21.680
Doshi? That monster mentioned Soshin...

20:21.680 --> 20:23.540
That's a misunderstanding.

20:23.780 --> 20:26.560
The Soshin lack intellect. 
They are defective.

20:26.560 --> 20:29.880
They are scum not even 
permitted to enter Horai.

20:30.300 --> 20:35.140
The doshi serve the Tensen directly. 
We are their right hand.

20:35.440 --> 20:37.970
Within the palace we study under the Tensen

20:37.970 --> 20:41.050
while looking after them 
and handling troublesome tasks.

20:41.050 --> 20:43.640
That is our responsibility.

20:43.640 --> 20:46.550
Horai... Palace...

20:46.550 --> 20:48.280
So, please.

20:48.920 --> 20:52.160
Go back into the hole 
and allow yourselves to become tan.

20:55.410 --> 20:56.910
Barbarous.

20:57.660 --> 20:58.400
Brother.

21:03.290 --> 21:05.460
How is he so strong?

21:09.300 --> 21:12.730
You're superhuman. Did you consume the tao?

21:12.730 --> 21:13.800
Shut up.

21:13.800 --> 21:17.310
If you work for those Tensen,

21:17.310 --> 21:21.920
then beating you is 
the shortest route to them.

21:22.420 --> 21:24.680
How convenient.

21:25.150 --> 21:27.670
I'll force answers out of you.

21:28.190 --> 21:29.810
Very well.

21:29.810 --> 21:32.940
If you don't seek a peaceful resolution,

21:32.940 --> 21:35.940
then I am prepared 
to handle you accordingly.

21:35.940 --> 21:39.440
You deeply sinful and foolish human.

21:39.440 --> 21:43.950
You'll realize you would have been happier 
if you'd just allowed yourself to become tan.

21:44.290 --> 21:45.450
Brother—

21:44.290 --> 21:45.450
Toma.

21:46.340 --> 21:47.720
Kill the nobodies.

21:48.560 --> 21:49.790
I'm counting on you.

21:51.260 --> 21:52.800
Got it.

21:57.570 --> 21:59.550
You focus on him.

22:00.520 --> 22:02.560
<i>This man is strong.</i>

22:02.560 --> 22:05.480
<i>But he is exhausted.</i>

22:05.930 --> 22:09.060
<i>One look at the flow 
of his tao, and it's obvious.</i>

22:15.410 --> 22:18.700
<i>He moves well despite 
his injuries. It's astounding.</i>

22:19.180 --> 22:20.680
<i>But it's pointless.</i>

22:20.680 --> 22:24.200
<i>Attacks from one 
who cannot use tao are trivial.</i>

22:24.510 --> 22:27.280
<i>He has predisposition 
for it, but that's all.</i>

22:27.280 --> 22:29.240
<i>Attacks weak in tao 
aren't merely ineffective.</i>

22:29.240 --> 22:32.090
<i>I can regenerate from them instantly.</i>

22:35.490 --> 22:38.040
<i>He is astounding, but...</i>

22:38.480 --> 22:41.550
<i>The disturbance in his tao reflects 
a blind spot in his awareness.</i>

22:41.550 --> 22:42.550
<i>It is an opening.</i>

22:51.960 --> 22:54.000
Brother!
